# 💰 AI-Powered Expense Management System

## 📌 Project Overview

AI-Powered Expense Management System is a Salesforce Administrator project designed to automate employee expense claim management.

The system allows employees to submit expense claims, upload receipts, track approval status, and receive automated notifications. Managers can review, approve, or reject claims through a streamlined approval process.

---

## 🚀 Features

✅ Expense Claim Management

✅ Expense Item Tracking

✅ Receipt File Upload

✅ Validation Rules

✅ Record-Triggered Flow Automation

✅ Approval Process

✅ AI-Based Risk Assessment

✅ Reports & Dashboards

✅ Security & Sharing Model

